  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Execute Advanced Data Queries with GraphQL",
    "splashDescription": "The GraphQL Connector is your bridge to efficient, flexible, and powerful data interactions. Capitalize on the strengths of GraphQL's single-endpoint and specifically-tailored data responses. From precise queries to dynamic mutations, streamline your data needs directly into your process. Simplify data-fetching tasks, minimize over-fetching, and optimize process performance.",
